<!-- Test Case: Schedule E - Rental loss in the special allowance phaseout -->
<!-- Scenario: Actively participating landlord with modified AGI between $100,000 and $150,000 -->
<!-- Rental income: $12,000, Expenses: $30,000, Loss: ($18,000) -->
<!-- Expected: $15,000 of the loss allowed, $3,000 suspended (IRS Pub 925; Form 8582 Part II) -->
<job>
